dlm: handle release_option as unsigned

jira KERNEL-878
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.120.1.el8_10
commit-author Alexander Aring <aahringo@redhat.com>
commit 8d90041a0d285044b89629f539ca0685e156848b
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.120.1.el8_10/8d90041a.failed

Future patches will introduce a invalid argument check for undefined
values. All values for release_option are positive integer values to not
check on negative values as well we just change the parameter to
unsigned int.

	Signed-off-by: Alexander Aring <aahringo@redhat.com>
	Signed-off-by: David Teigland <teigland@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit 8d90041a0d285044b89629f539ca0685e156848b)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

